\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
1. Motivation
\f1\b0\fs32 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 This dataset was created as part of the Black-Box Optimisation (BBO) capstone project. The goal of the project is to optimise eight unknown functions through iterative querying. Since the internal structure of the functions is hidden, the dataset supports research and experimentation in sequential optimisation under uncertainty.
\f1 \

\f2 The dataset enables analysis of:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Exploration vs exploitation trade-offs
\f1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sequential decision-making
\f1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Surrogate modelling experiments
\f1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Convergence behaviour over time
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 2. Composition
\f1\b0\fs32 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 The dataset contains:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Weekly query inputs for 8 black-box functions
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Corresponding function outputs returned by the evaluation portal
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Data collected across 10 iterations (so far)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}8 functions with dimensionality:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}2D (Functions 1 & 2)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}3D (Function 3)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}4D (Functions 4 & 5)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}5D (Function 6)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}6D (Function 7)
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl1
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}8D (Function 8)
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Size:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}10 data points per function (80 total records)
\f1 \
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Structured in CSV format:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl1
\f3\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}function_id
\f1\fs32 \
\ls3\ilvl1
\f3\fs26\fsmilli13333 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}x1, x2, ..., xn
\f1\fs32 \
\ls3\ilvl1
\f3\fs26\fsmilli13333 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}y
\f2\fs32 \'a0(function output)
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Gaps:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sparse coverage in high-dimensional spaces
\f1 \
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Limited exploration in some regions due to budget constraints
\f1 \
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}No access to ground truth function definitions
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 3. Collection Process
\f1\b0\fs32 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 Queries were generated manually using a structured optimisation strategy over 10 weeks.
\f1 \

\f2 The process evolved as follows:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Weeks 1\'963: Broad exploration
\f1 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Weeks 4\'966: Identification of promising regions
\f1 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Weeks 7\'9610: Local refinement (micro hill-climbing) for high-performing functions
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 Strategy characteristics:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sequential learning from previous outputs
\f1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Trend-based adjustments
\f1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Step-size reduction as performance stabilised
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 Data was collected weekly via the capstone portal.
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

